es.<br /> <br /> The only thing I thought was missing was an enviromental tilt of a Black Blizzard. Aside from what Marin said, of course.<br /> <br /> But the chapter is really awesome. I'll certainly run a game out of this.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 1e rules. No Conditions, that's why. I'll do one up and post it here, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T22:14:23-08:00","id":397201,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/385893-dark-eras-hollow-disquiet-wasteland?p=386932#post386932\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, that's for the &quot;unedited text, please edit that in&quot; pile.<br /> <br /> Though, on a broader note, I think it's actually brilliant we have a Lineage with an explicit sell-by date.</div> </div> </div> </div>Makes me imagine a similar phenomenon during pandemic plagues, with short-term lineages animated by the swarm of the microb organinisms festering through their form (not that people would understand it in those terms before the modern era). So you can have a Black Death Created in 14th Century Europe, or Smallpox Created in 16th Century Americas - etc. Probably deserve a proprietary Transmutation type for disease and controlling/warping the infected.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T16:24:27-07:00","id":443234,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/385893-dark-eras-hollow-disquiet-wasteland?p=397201#post397201\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Makes me imagine a similar phenomenon during pandemic plagues, with short-term lineages animated by the swarm of the microb organinisms festering through their form (not that people would understand it in those terms before the modern era). So you can have a Black Death Created in 14th Century Europe, or Smallpox Created in 16th Century Americas - etc. Probably deserve a proprietary Transmutation type for disease and controlling/warping the infected.</div> </div> </div> </div>And tuberculosis Created that everyone mistakes for Vampires?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5158-xenu-s-paradox","name":"Xenu's Paradox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"212"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T01:24:00-07:00","id":455541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/385893-dark-eras-hollow-disquiet-wasteland?p=386932#post386932\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe Hollow only appear and can be Redeemed during periods of famine and drought anywhere...mostly because I want there to be hope for the survivors of the rains.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or maybe there's a Hollow, after wandering the world in hopes of finding another place that would allow him to continue his Pilgrimage, driven by the desperation of that feeling of starvation gnawing at him for decades, who finally gives into the idea that's been haunting him for years: to attempt to recreate the Dust Bowl, by any means, even if it means hunting down whatever other Hollows still exist and imprisoning them to blight the Midwest with their Wastelands... and perhaps to do the same to other Prometheans out of increasing desperation.<br /> <br /> Hope can be a terrible thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2286-indarkestknight","name":"indarke